As NC: 2026:KHC:6583 HC-KAR per Ex.P22 - Wound Certificate, she sustained the following injuries:
"a) Fracture proximal end of left tibia and fibula;
b) Abrasion over left eye brow below left eye;
c) Lateral aspect of left elbow;
d) Anterior aspect of left leg, right elbow;
e) Tenderness and welling over medial proximal of left leg."

As per Ex.P22 - Wound Certificate, he sustained the following grevious injuries:
"a) Complete tear of anterior cruisate ligament;
b) Peri articular and poplitea soft tissue contusion;
c) Abrasion over right forearm, right foot near ankle joint;
d) Lacerated wound over Tip of left fore finger;
e) Tenderness over right knee."
